            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wywołanie <code>.pop()</code> bez indeksu usuwa ostatni element listy.</p><p>Który kod usunie <code>\"sleep\"</code> z listy <code>plans = [\"work\", \"eat\", \"sleep\"]</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>plans.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>plans.insert()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>plans.pop(0)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>plans.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>"
